<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Hyosung T&amp;C H1 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Hyosung T&amp;C H1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)			 648  vs    417</p>
<p>    Net				5.32  vs   3.36</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	    6.33  vs   4.02</p>
<p>    Revenue			628.31  vs  542.67</p>
<p>NOTE - Hyosung T&amp;C, formerly known as Tong Yang Nylon, is one of South Korea's largest synthetic fiber makers. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
</text>
